      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've had this idea for months, but as a slider instead of a button. You should be able to adjust the distance you can hear people from. This would let you have a conversation in a booth with another person or small group, and let you slide it all the way up to hear someone on stage. \n\nThis could also let the sound system be set back the way it was before it was broken months ago to try to deal with people with overly loud avatars, which they just adjusted to get right around the limits anyway. If it was set up properly as a client side local limit, the devs wouldn't have to worry about it. We'd just do it ourselves.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
