      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Almost 5 years I made this suggestions so thought to comment an update. Since I saw this was updated to being tracked.\n\nThe new earmuffs system works but it is a one-way meaning you can ONLY hear players within the bubble distance that you set. I would love it to work with voice distance / range as well. I feel my WHISPER idea or just voice distance whatever you want to call it could work with the earmuff system. Again being able to change my voice distance in any world would be useful for any club or any social interaction just like IRL. In the real world I can change my voice volume to be lower so I don't disturb other people nearby it's quite useful.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
